 lsp/analysis.rkt                       | 34 +++++++++---
 lsp/source-controller/source-owner.rkt |  6 +--
 tests/lsp/open-buffer-imports-test.rkt | 74 +++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 4 files changed, 116 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)

